#. type: Hash Value: upcomingevents description
#: _data/events.yaml:1
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "The Quarkus community virtual conference is a free, open-access online event held over two half-days on February 2–3, 2027. Streamed live, the conference features presentations, technical sessions, and interactive panel discussions focused on key topics like enterprise Java adoption, cloud-native development, and Java for AI. Built and driven by the community, the event brings together developers, contributors, and industry experts to share insights, engage in live Q&A, and foster open-source innovation."
msgstr "Quarkus 社区虚拟会议是一场免费、开放的在线活动，将于 2027 年 2 月 2 日至 3 日分两个半天举行。 本次会议将通过直播形式进行，内容包括主题演讲、技术研讨会和互动式小组讨论，重点探讨企业级 Java 应用、云原生开发以及 Java 在人工智能领域的应用等关键议题。该活动由社区自主策划并推动，旨在汇聚开发者、贡献者和行业专家，共同分享见解、参与实时问答，并推动开源创新。"

